# First run: the computer route is named, Check again sits under it, and when
# no server has arrived the banner that says so carries Check again over the
# address field, instead of leaving the owner to type the address twice.
wait-for Connect Readeck
expect kobo connect readeck
tap Check again
wait-for No server has arrived
clean
shot readeck-check-again
expect https://readeck.example
clean
shot readeck-server
expect Step 1 of 3
expect Server address
tap-id server-address
wait-for Readeck server address
type https://read.example
expect https://read.example
clean
shot readeck-address-typed
tap Next
wait-for Account key
expect Step 2 of 3
clean
shot readeck-token
tap Use phone
wait-for Opens the API token page
clean
shot readeck-phone
tap Back
wait-for Account key
